              },
              "help": {
                "text": "child_process.exec executes arbitrary commands in a shell environment, allowing command injection.\n\nRemediation: Use child_process.execFile() or spawn() without a shell, passing arguments in an array.",
                "markdown": "**Command Injection via child_process.exec**\n\nchild_process.exec executes arbitrary commands in a shell environment, allowing command injection.\n\n### Remediation\nUse child_process.execFile() or spawn() without a shell, passing arguments in an array."
